       "## Advanced Reasoning Components\n",
       "\n",
       "This section implements various components that enhance the model's reasoning capabilities:\n",
       "- ReasoningTracker: Maintains and refines reasoning state through multiple steps\n",
       "- TreeOfThought: Explores multiple reasoning paths to find optimal solutions\n",
       "- AlgorithmicReasoner: Implements a neural register-based computation system\n",
       "- CalculatorTool: Provides symbolic math evaluation capabilities"
      ]
